        was close! Told ya I can handle it. Hehe~","parentUIDs":[12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":5,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":2}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":484,"yPos":22},"ID":1,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"But
        still, you''re kinda stupid to compromise the base from your sketchy, unprotected,
        pirated game!","parentUIDs":[0],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":8,"Volume":0.8},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":34}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":244,"yPos":139},"ID":2,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"But
        hey, I fixed the problem, right? And I''ve also learned my lesson.","parentUIDs":[1],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":4,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":8}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":242,"yPos":260},"ID":3,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Yeah,
        totally got it. Won''t do it again! Unless... if it''s the new upcoming Retropunk
        2007!","parentUIDs":[34],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":10,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":9}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":481,"yPos":256},"ID":8,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"WOLF!","parentUIDs":[3],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":1.5,"Volume":0.8},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":31}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":240,"yPos":372},"ID":9,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Hahaha!
